rent  variations of the sinister six team uh  because it wasn't always sinister six  right you had the sinister six then you  had return then you had revenge and it  was those were okay right they weren't  really that great honestly it was less  about the sinister six trying to defeat  spider-man and more about the sinister  six trying to conquer the world right so  it really kind of lost its its its  legacy its value its meaning when you  got around to those stories but let me  know if you guys are interested in  seeing those with that being said guys  we're gonna bring this to an end thank  you guys for watching and i will catch  you all later  peace

